agents-orchestrator branch feat/session-project-grants (commit 25dbd0b, T-120 project grants, PR #113), /agent/v1 paths only (method + operationId). Re-vendored from its openapi.json: for each path starting with /agent/v1 write {"paths": {path: {method: {"operationId": id}}}} with sorted keys and indent 1. Only the four project grant operations (POST and DELETE /agent/v1/admin/{sessions/{slug},presets/{ref}}/projects[/{project}]) are new against the previous vendoring (v7.9.0); re-vendor from the released tag before tagging this plugin.
